profile=Quality preset
profile.comment=Ultra Low and Low cut the most expensive effects; Medium (default) is the shader's intended look; High raises the quality of the volumetrics and reflections.
profile.ULTRA_LOW=Ultra Low
profile.ULTRA_LOW.comment=Integrated or very weak GPUs: 1 shadow cascade at 2048, no cloud shadows, minimum volumetrics, no SSR, no micro detail.
profile.LOW=Low
profile.LOW.comment=Older entry-level GPUs: 3 cascades at 2048, medium volumetrics, SSR with 64 steps.
profile.MEDIUM=Medium (default)
profile.MEDIUM.comment=The shader's intended settings (tuned on an RTX 3050 6 GB).
profile.HIGH=High
profile.HIGH.comment=Ultra volumetrics (96 slices) and SSR with 128 steps. Costs more than Medium; the FPS depends on the scene, the resolution and the PC.
